gavY(){return"How do I find an answer in the FAQs?"},
gaur(){return"Search with one or more words or choose a topic. Search ignores accents, case and punctuation and recognizes some common alternative words. Search and topic filters work together: if there are no results, use Show all FAQs to start again. Use Contact support for assistance and choose Email support if you need a reply."},
