gayS(){return"Back to Settings"},
gayR(){return"This feature is available in the Android app. To add the widget, open Band Calendar on your Android phone."},
gasq(){return"The Home Screen calendar page shows an illustrative preview with sample data. Press Add to Home Screen and confirm in the prompt on your phone. Confirm on your phone indicates a request, not that the widget has already been added. If the prompt does not appear or the request fails, open How to add it manually. After adding it, touch and hold the widget to resize it, if your phone supports this."},
