gav_(){return"How do I delete a group or a project?"},
gasK(){return"If you are the owner, open Band or project settings. To delete a group, select it and open the actions beside its name: Delete group is the last item. If it contains members, choose their destination group. Apply the change with Save changes; at least one group must remain. To permanently delete the project, scroll to the bottom of Band and choose Delete project; in standalone project settings, use the top-right menu. Complete the typed confirmation."},
